MIT_KEMAR_normal_pinna.sofa - head-related transfer functions of the KEMAR
dummy head with the normal pinna, converted to the SOFA format.

Copyright 1994 Bill Gardner <billg@media.mit.edu>, Keith Martin
<kdm@media.mit.edu>, MIT Media Lab Machine Listening Group.

This data is Copyright 1994 by the MIT Media Laboratory. It is provided free
with no restrictions on use, provided the authors are cited when the data is
used in any research or commercial application.

The SOFA conversion is the one that ships with libmysofa
(https://github.com/hoene/libmysofa, share/MIT_KEMAR_normal_pinna.sofa);
SHA-256 2768ac841213a7ae11d1ea7fd0f25a69b39216102dc5dd913ea6ba0f0dc57e28.
